2Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;font-weight:600;font-size:14.5px;letter-spacing:1px\">\n    <a href=\"#menu\" style=\"color:#CBBBA0\">MENU<\u002Fa>\n    <a href=\"#story\" style=\"color:#CBBBA0\">OUR STORY<\u002Fa>\n    <a href=\"#reviews\" style=\"color:#CBBBA0\">REVIEWS<\u002Fa>\n    <a href=\"#visit\" style=\"border:1px solid #C9A15C;color:#C9A15C;padding:11px 22px;border-radius:2px\" style-hover=\"background:#C9A15C;color:#14100C\">RESERVE A TABLE<\u002Fa>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fnav>\n\n<!-- Hero -->\n<header style=\"position:relative;min-height:86vh;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(rgba(20,16,12,.55),rgba(20,16,12,.88)),url(&quot;060d80bc-486f-4b98-a411-7901ae0b2521&quot;) center/cover\">\n  <div style=\"padding:100px 5vw;max-width:780px\">\n    <div style=\"animation:heroUp .9s ease both;color:#C9A15C;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px\">HANDMADE PASTA · WOOD FIRE · NATURAL WINE<\u002Fdiv>\n    <h1 style=\"animation:heroUp .9s .15s ease both;font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-size:clamp(48px,7vw,92px);line-height:1.04;margin:24px 0;font-weight:400\">A little corner of Italy in <em style=\"color:#C9A15C\">Providence<\u002Fem><\u002Fh1>\n    <p style=\"animation:heroUp .9s .3s ease both;color:#CBBBA0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 auto 36px;max-width:520px\">Fresh pasta rolled every morning. A wood oven that never sleeps. Twenty-two seats, one long table, and food worth lingering over.<\u002Fp>\n    <div style=\"animation:heroUp .9s .45s ease both;display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n      <a href=\"#visit\" style=\"background:#C9A15C;color:#14100C;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1.5px;padding:16px 34px;border-radius:2px\" style-hover=\"background:#EFE6D8;color:#14100C\">RESERVE A TABLE<\u002Fa>\n      <a href=\"#menu\" style=\"border:1px solid rgba(239,230,216,.4);color:#EFE6D8;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1.5px;padding:16px 34px;border-radius:2px\" style-hover=\"border-color:#C9A15C;color:#C9A15C\">SEE THE MENU<\u002Fa>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:rgba(20,16,12,.75);border-top:1px solid rgba(201,161,92,.25);display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:clamp(20px,6vw,80px);padding:16px 5vw;font-size:13.5px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#CBBBA0;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n    <div>TUE–SUN · 5PM–11PM<\u002Fdiv>\n    <div>14 WESTMINSTER ST, PROVIDENCE RI<\u002Fdiv>\n    <div>(401) 555-0189<\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fheader>\n\n<!-- Story -->\n<section id=\"story\" style=\"max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:100px 5vw;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:60px;align-items:center\">\n  <div data-reveal=\"\" style=\"position:relative\">\n    <img src=\"41e6806a-8af2-411f-a4cc-1801f322aea1\" alt=\"Chef at work\" style=\"width:100%;display:block;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;border-radius:2px\">\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;right:-16px;bottom:-16px;background:#C9A15C;color:#14100C;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:2px\">\n      <div style=\"font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-size:34px;line-height:1\">Since 2015<\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:1.5px;margin-top:4px\">FAMILY OWNED &amp; RUN<\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n  <div data-reveal=\"\">\n    <div style=\"color:#C9A15C;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px\">OUR STORY<\u002Fdiv>\n    <h2 style=\"font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,52px);line-height:1.12;margin:16px 0 20px\">Nonna's recipes, a wood fire, and not much else<\u002Fh2>\n    <p style=\"color:#CBBBA0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px\">Chef Elena Moretti grew up rolling tagliatelle on her grandmother's kitchen table outside Bologna. Osteria Lume is that table, transplanted — the same recipes, the same stubborn insistence on doing everything by hand.<\u002Fp>\n    <p style=\"color:#CBBBA0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 28px\">The menu changes with the seasons and the farmers' market. The pasta never comes from a box. And the last course is always on the house if it's your birthday.<\u002Fp>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:40px\">\n      <div><div style=\"font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-size:32px;color:#C9A15C\">7<\u002Fdiv><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#8F7F68\">PASTAS DAILY<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n      <div><div style=\"font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-size:32px;color:#C9A15C\">40+<\u002Fdiv><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#8F7F68\">NATURAL WINES<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n      <div><div style=\"font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-size:32px;color:#C9A15C\">22<\u002Fdiv><div style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#8F7F68\">SEATS<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<!-- Menu -->\n<section id=\"menu\" style=\"background:#1C1712;border-top:1px solid rgba(201,161,92,.15);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,161,92,.15);padding:100px 5vw\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:900px;margin:0 auto\">\n    <div data-reveal=\"\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px\">\n      <div style=\"color:#C9A15C;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px\">THE MENU<\u002Fdiv>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(36px,4.2vw,56px);margin:14px 0 0\">Tonight at Lume<\u002Fh2>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n    <div data-reveal=\"\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:44px\">\n      <sc-for list=\"{{ menuTabs }}\" as=\"t\">\n        <button onclick=\"{{ t.go }}\" style=\"background:{{ t.bg }};color:{{ t.color }};border:1px solid {{ t.border }};cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;letter-spacing:1.5px;padding:11px 22px;border-radius:2px;transition:all .25s\">{{ t.label }}<\u002Fbutton>\n      <\u002Fsc-for>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:8px 56px;animation:fadeIn .5s ease\" key=\"{{ activeTab }}\">\n      <sc-for list=\"{{ menuItems }}\" as=\"m\" hint-placeholder-count=\"6\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,161,92,.15)\">\n          <div>\n            <div style=\"font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-size:21px\">{{ m.name }}<\u002Fdiv>\n            <div style=\"color:#8F7F68;font-size:14px;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.5\">{{ m.desc }}<\u002Fdiv>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1;border-bottom:1px dotted rgba(201,161,92,.35);transform:translateY(-6px)\"><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#C9A15C;white-space:nowrap\">{{ m.price }}<\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fsc-for>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n    <p data-reveal=\"\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#8F7F68;font-size:14px;margin-top:36px;font-style:italic\">Menu changes weekly with the market. Please tell us about allergies — our kitchen is small and happy to adapt.<\u002Fp>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<!-- Gallery strip -->\n<section style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:4px;padding:4px\">\n  <sc-for list=\"{{ gallery }}\" as=\"g\" hint-placeholder-count=\"4\">\n    <div data-reveal=\"\" style=\"overflow:hidden\">\n      <img src=\"{{ g }}\" alt=\"Dish at Osteria Lume\" style=\"width:100%;display:block;aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .7s ease\" style-hover=\"transform:scale(1.07)\">\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fsc-for>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<!-- Google reviews -->\n<section id=\"reviews\" style=\"max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:100px 5vw\">\n  <div data-reveal=\"\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-bottom:44px\">\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"color:#C9A15C;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px\">WHAT GUESTS SAY<\u002Fdiv>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,52px);margin:14px 0 0\">Loved on Google<\u002Fh2>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n    <div style=\"background:#fff;color:#1F1F1F;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:26px;font-family:'Karla',sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#4285F4\">G<\u002Fspan><span style=\"color:#EA4335\">o<\u002Fspan><span style=\"color:#FBBC05\">o<\u002Fspan><span style=\"color:#4285F4\">g<\u002Fspan><span style=\"color:#34A853\">l<\u002Fspan><span style=\"color:#EA4335\">e<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n      <div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\"><strong style=\"font-size:20px\">4.8<\u002Fstrong><span style=\"color:#FBBC05;letter-spacing:1px\">★★★★★<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#5F6368\">Based on 512 Google reviews<\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n  <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:20px\">\n    <sc-for list=\"{{ reviews }}\" as=\"r\" hint-placeholder-count=\"3\">\n      <div data-reveal=\"\" style=\"background:#1C1712;border:1px solid rgba(201,161,92,.2);border-radius:10px;padding:26px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px\">\n          <div style=\"width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;background:{{ r.avatarBg }};color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;font-size:17px\">{{ r.initial }}<\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1\">\n            <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:15px\">{{ r.name }}<\u002Fdiv>\n            <div style=\"color:#8F7F68;font-size:12.5px\">{{ r.meta }}<\u002Fdiv>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4285F4,#34A853);width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:14px\">G<\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"color:#FBBC05;letter-spacing:2px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:10px\">★★★★★<\u002Fdiv>\n        <p style=\"color:#CBBBA0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;margin:0\">“{{ r.text }}”<\u002Fp>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fsc-for>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<!-- Visit / Reserve -->\n<section id=\"visit\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(rgba(20,16,12,.82),rgba(20,16,12,.82)),url(&quot;0ea70830-52ea-4167-91b1-b7bbeb5319ee&quot;) center/cover;padding:110px 5vw;text-align:center\">\n  <div data-reveal=\"\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto\">\n    <div style=\"color:#C9A15C;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px\">RESERVATIONS<\u002Fdiv>\n    <h2 style=\"font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(36px,4.5vw,58px);margin:16px 0 14px\">Your table is waiting<\u002Fh2>\n    <p style=\"color:#CBBBA0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 34px\">We're small on purpose — 22 seats fill quickly, especially Friday and Saturday. Call ahead or reserve online.<\u002Fp>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n      <a href=\"tel:4015550189\" style=\"background:#C9A15C;color:#14100C;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1.5px;padding:17px 36px;border-radius:2px\" style-hover=\"background:#EFE6D8;color:#14100C\">CALL (401) 555-0189<\u002Fa>\n      <a href=\"#visit\" style=\"border:1px solid rgba(239,230,216,.4);color:#EFE6D8;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1.5px;padding:17px 36px;border-radius:2px\" style-hover=\"border-color:#C9A15C;color:#C9A15C\">RESERVE ONLINE<\u002Fa>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:44px;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:clamp(24px,5vw,60px);flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#CBBBA0\">\n      <div><strong style=\"color:#C9A15C;display:block;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:4px\">HOURS<\u002Fstrong>Tue–Sun · 5–11pm<\u002Fdiv>\n      <div><strong style=\"color:#C9A15C;display:block;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:4px\">FIND US<\u002Fstrong>14 Westminster St, Providence<\u002Fdiv>\n      <div><strong style=\"color:#C9A15C;display:block;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:4px\">PRIVATE EVENTS<\u002Fstrong>events@osterialume.com<\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<!-- Footer -->\n<footer style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(201,161,92,.2);padding:36px 5vw;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;color:#8F7F68;font-size:13.5px;letter-spacing:1px\">\n  <div style=\"font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#EFE6D8\">Osteria <span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#C9A15C\">Lume<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n  <div>14 WESTMINSTER ST, PROVIDENCE, RI · (401) 555-0189<\u002Fdiv>\n  <div>TUE–SUN 5–11PM<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Ffooter>\n\n<\u002Fx-dc>\n<script type=\"text/x-dc\" data-dc-script=\"\">\nclass Component extends DCLogic {\n  state = { tab: 'Pasta' };\n\n  componentDidMount() {\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver((es) => {\n      es.forEach(e => { if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add('on'); io.unobserve(e.target); } });\n    }, { threshold: 0.12 });\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]').forEach(el => io.observe(el));\n    this._io = io;\n  }\n  componentWillUnmount() { if (this._io) this._io.disconnect(); }\n\n  menu() {\n    return {\n      'Antipasti': [\n        { name: 'Burrata e Prosciutto', desc: 'Creamy burrata, 24-month prosciutto, grilled bread', price: '16' },\n        { name: 'Polpette della Nonna', desc: 'Beef & pork meatballs, Sunday sugo, pecorino', price: '14' },\n        { name: 'Carciofi Fritti', desc: 'Crispy artichokes, lemon aioli, mint', price: '13' },\n        { name: 'Crudo di Branzino', desc: 'Sea bass, blood orange, Calabrian chili oil', price: '17' },\n      ],\n      'Pasta': [\n        { name: 'Tagliatelle al Ragù', desc: 'Nonna\\u2019s 6-hour bolognese, parmigiano', price: '24' },\n        { name: 'Cacio e Pepe', desc: 'Tonnarelli, pecorino romano, cracked black pepper', price: '21' },\n        { name: 'Agnolotti di Zucca', desc: 'Squash-filled, brown butter, sage, amaretti crumb', price: '23' },\n        { name: 'Bucatini all\\u2019Amatriciana', desc: 'Guanciale, tomato, chili, pecorino', price: '22' },\n        { name: 'Lasagna al Forno', desc: 'Wood-oven baked, béchamel, basil — limited nightly', price: '26' },\n        { name: 'Gnocchi al Pomodoro', desc: 'Pillowy potato gnocchi, San Marzano, basil oil', price: '20' },\n      ],\n      'Dal Forno': [\n        { name: 'Branzino al Sale', desc: 'Whole salt-baked sea bass, salsa verde, lemon', price: '34' },\n        { name: 'Pollo al Mattone', desc: 'Brick-pressed half chicken, rosemary potatoes', price: '28' },\n        { name: 'Bistecca Tagliata', desc: '14oz ribeye, arugula, parmigiano, aged balsamic', price: '42' },\n        { name: 'Melanzane alla Parmigiana', desc: 'Wood-fired eggplant, mozzarella, basil', price: '22' },\n      ],\n      'Dolci': [\n        { name: 'Tiramisù della Casa', desc: 'Espresso-soaked savoiardi, mascarpone, cocoa', price: '11' },\n        { name: 'Panna Cotta', desc: 'Vanilla bean, macerated seasonal fruit', price: '10' },\n        { name: 'Affogato', desc: 'Fior di latte gelato drowned in hot espresso', price: '9' },\n        { name: 'Cannoli Siciliani', desc: 'Ricotta, candied orange, pistachio — pair of two', price: '10' },\n      ],\n    };\n  }\n\n  renderVals() {\n    const menu = this.menu();\n    const tabs = Object.keys(menu);\n    return {\n      activeTab: this.state.tab,\n      menuTabs: tabs.map(t => ({\n        label: t.toUpperCase(),\n        bg: t === this.state.tab ? '#C9A15C' : 'transparent',\n        color: t === this.state.tab ? '#14100C' : '#CBBBA0',\n        border: t === this.state.tab ? '#C9A15C' : 'rgba(201,161,92,.35)',\n        go: () => this.setState({ tab: t }),\n      })),\n      menuItems: menu[this.state.tab],\n      gallery: [\n        'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555396273-367ea4eb4db5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=70',\n        'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551183053-bf91a1d81141?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=70',\n        'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1481931098730-318b6f776db0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=70',\n        'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544025162-d76694265947?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=70',\n      ],\n      reviews: [\n        { initial: 'L', avatarBg: '#7B5EA7', name: 'Laura Bennett', meta: 'Local Guide · 82 reviews', text: 'The tagliatelle al ragù is the single best pasta I\\u2019ve eaten outside of Italy. Tiny room, huge heart. Book ahead — it\\u2019s worth planning around.' },\n        { initial: 'M', avatarBg: '#3D8361', name: 'Marco DiStefano', meta: '14 reviews · 2 weeks ago', text: 'My nonna was from Bologna and I was ready to be unimpressed. I was not. Elena came out to say hello and we talked recipes for ten minutes.' },\n        { initial: 'A', avatarBg: '#C05746', name: 'Aisha Thompson', meta: 'Local Guide · 156 reviews', text: 'Anniversary dinner — they wrote on our dessert plate in chocolate and comped the affogato. Warm, unfussy, and the wine list is full of surprises.' },\n      ],\n    };\n  }\n}\n<\u002Fscript>\n\n\n<\u002Fbody><\u002Fhtml>"
  </script>
